title: Preposterous
type: text/vnd.tiddlywiki

Futures that "could never happen." The ridiculous ones, outside the [[Possible]] in [[The Futures Cone]].

[[Joseph Voros]] added this band to the cone. Useful ideas about the future often start out sounding ridiculous.

Aim out here for long enough and the cone moves. What was preposterous becomes possible. See [[Adjacent Possibles]].

See [[These Gestures Are Undoubtedly Utopian (v4)]], [[Speculative Design]]
